@ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7110
@ReferenceNumber = CG-501

### Platform health
GET {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/health
Accept: application/json

### Create a draft change request
POST {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referenceNumber": "{{ReferenceNumber}}",
  "title": "Improve payment validation",
  "description": "Prevent duplicate settlements and improve audit visibility.",
  "priority": "Critical",
  "actor": "product-owner@changeguard.local"
}

### Search requests
GET {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Dashboard
GET {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### Request details
GET {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests/{{ReferenceNumber}}
Accept: application/json

### Submit the draft for requirement review
POST {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests/{{ReferenceNumber}}/workflow
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SubmitForReview",
  "actor": "product-owner@changeguard.local",
  "comment": "Requirements and acceptance criteria are ready for review."
}

### Record release evidence (valid during development or QA)
PUT {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests/{{ReferenceNumber}}/release-artifacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qaEvidenceNotes": null,
  "rollbackPlan": "Redeploy the previous container image and restore the backup.",
  "actor": "developer@changeguard.local"
}

### Release-readiness decision
GET {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests/{{ReferenceNumber}}/release-readiness
Accept: application/json

### Audit trail
GET {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/api/change-requests/{{ReferenceNumber}}/audit
Accept: application/json

### Container liveness
GET {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Database readiness
GET {{ChangeGuard_Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
